WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.838
Luke Cage is more than a power tool exfoliating Jessica Jones Love interest. 

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:08.408
He has huge history of heroics and interesting fashion choices.  

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.443
Also, he's getting his own show

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:13.980
So before you watch the show, find out, Who the heck is Luke Cage?

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:22.288
He started out as Carl Lucas on the rough streets of Harlem in the 70s.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:25.692
He and his childhood friend, Willis Striker, were criminals. 

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.862
Striker used knives, but Carl prefered his fists. 

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.997
The two meet Reva Conners. 

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:34.234
Both fell for her, but Striker ended up getting the girl.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:38.038
The two subsequently break up because of a reeeeeeally bad date. 

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:41.608
Striker blames Carl for the breakout and plants heroin in his house. 

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:44.210
Classic over-reaction right? 

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.113
Carl goes to prison and doesn't make friends with the inmates,  

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.883
Reva dies in a car wreck caused by Striker, 

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.085
Carl doesn’t make friends with the guards, 

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:56.022
Striker adopts the name Diamondback and now “runs this town”, 

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:58.992
Carl makes friends with Doctor Noah Burstien

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:03.029
who puts him in a “Biochemical Electrical Bath” made by Stark industries

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:06.066
which gives him Super-strength, Invulnerable skin and quick healing. 

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:09.202
Luke Cage - I came out with abilities.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:12.138
Carl uses these powers to escape the prison. 

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:16.576
Once out he changes his name to Luke Cage, because he just got out of one. 

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.212
Wanting revenge to Revas death 

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:23.450
Luke does the logical thing and makes calling cards for a “Hero for Hire” 

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.652
and starts messing with Diamondbacks business. 

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:29.122
Oh and he goes to a constume shop and buys this sweet outfit. 

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:34.360
He and Striker fight and Striker blows himself up with an exploding knife thing.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:37.664
Luke then goes into business, Heroing for money. 

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:42.268
Later, Luke starts going by Power Man because it is heroically marketable.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:45.772
After a short time, Iron Fist joins Heroes for Hire 

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.708
nd the two go on to beat up dudes with fantastic names like 

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:50.176
Cockroach Hamilton, 

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.444
Cornell Cottonmouth,

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.545
Mister Fish

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:54.147
And Freddy FireFace

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:57.183
I'm just kidding about the last one, but the rest are totally real.

00:01:57.183 --> 00:02:01.721
